cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the released SDG interaction matrix, please cite the paper below."
title: "Comparing Neighbour Retrieval and Interlinkage Graphs for Sustainable Development Goal Classification with Large Language Models"
abstract: >-
  Code, SDG-SDG interaction matrices, evaluation splits, and raw LLM predictions
  for a controlled comparison of label-graph propagation against per-document
  retrieval post-corrections for multi-label SDG classification of research
  abstracts.
